WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.337
Hi! I'm Daniel. Let me tell you about my Saturday. It was great!

2
00:00:06.787 --> 00:00:09.805
On Saturday, I woke up late, at ten o'clock.

3
00:00:10.255 --> 00:00:11.834
I was very tired!

4
00:00:14.084 --> 00:00:16.128
Then I went to the beach with my brother.

5
00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:19.968
We surfed for two hours. The waves were perfect!

6
00:00:22.218 --> 00:00:24.354
We had lunch at a small restaurant.

7
00:00:24.804 --> 00:00:27.683
I ate paella with seafood. Delicious!

8
00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:32.766
In the afternoon, I read a book in the garden.

9
00:00:33.216 --> 00:00:38.185
Read, read: the same letters, but a different sound in the past!

10
00:00:40.435 --> 00:00:45.265
In the evening, I met my friends in the park. We talked and laughed a lot.

11
00:00:45.715 --> 00:00:49.152
And you? Tell me three things you did last weekend!

